   "source": [
    "# 01 - Exploratory Data Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "## Objective\n",
    "Explore the Club Piscine franchise sales data to understand structure, coverage, and quality.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Data Sources (SharePoint Extracts)\n",
    "| File | Description | Rows |\n",
    "|---|---|---|\n",
    "| `Exemple_Table_Vente.xlsx` | Sales transactions | 139,133 |\n",
    "| `Exemple_Table_Inventaire.xlsx` | Inventory snapshot (Sept 9, 2025 only) | 18,958 |\n",
    "| `Table_Magasins.xlsx` | Store master: codes, cities, franchise groups | 49 |\n",
    "| `Exemple_Table_ITEM_TOTAL.xlsx` | Product catalogue: Division → Catégorie → Groupe | 133,864 |\n",
    "| `Table_Calendrier.xlsx` | Fiscal calendar (Nov 2023 → Oct 2026, daily) | 1,096 |\n",
    "\n",
    "## Key Schema\n",
    "| Column | Table | Role |\n",
    "|---|---|---|\n",
    "| `Date de Vente` | Vente | Sale date (preferred over `Date de la facture`) |\n",
    "| `Montant de la ligne` | Vente | Line amount CAD — **target variable** |\n",
    "| `Division Code` | Vente | Product division (PC, AP, PI, ME, BQ, SP…) |\n",
    "| `No. d'article` | Vente | Item code — joins to `No. Article` in ITEM_TOTAL |\n",
    "| `No. magasin` | Vente | Store code — joins to `Table_Magasins` |\n",
    "| `No. Article` | ITEM_TOTAL | Item code (100% match with Vente) |\n",
    "| `Catégorie` | ITEM_TOTAL | Sub-category within Division (177 values) |\n",
    "| `Groupe de produit` | ITEM_TOTAL | Product group within Catégorie (435 values) |\n",
    "| `Répliqué-Franchisé` | ITEM_TOTAL | 1 = shared catalogue item, 0 = local purchase |\n",
    "| `Fin de semaine` | Calendrier | Week-end date — **join key for Power BI** |\n",
    "| `FiscalYear/Quarter/Month` | Calendrier | Fiscal labels for Power BI semantic model |\n",
    "| `_Semaine fiscale NEW` | Calendrier | Club Piscine fiscal week number |\n",
    "\n",
    "## Outputs\n",
    "- `data/processed/weekly_sales.csv` — Weekly × Store × Division × Catégorie\n",
    "- `data/processed/store_region_map.csv` — Store → city mapping\n",
    "- `data/processed/item_category_map.csv` — Article → Division/Catégorie/Groupe lookup\n",
    "---"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
