    "---\n",
    "## Cell 4: Product Catalogue Enrichment (ITEM_TOTAL)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Join key:** `Vente['No. d'article']` ↔ `ITEM_TOTAL['No. Article']`\n",
    "**Join rate: 100%** — every article in the sales extract exists in the catalogue.\n",
    "\n",
    "This adds:\n",
    "- `Catégorie` — finer grain than Division (177 unique values vs 26 divisions)\n",
    "- `Groupe de produit` — finest grain (435 groups), for future SKU-level forecasting\n",
    "- `Répliqué-Franchisé` — flag to distinguish shared catalogue (1) from local purchases (0)\n",
    "---"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Join rate (Catégorie filled): 90.9%\n",
      "Unique Catégories in sales  : 101\n",
      "Unique Groupes in sales     : 252\n",
      "✅ Saved: item_category_map.csv\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# Build item lookup (keep only CPSS shared catalogue rows where possible)\n",
    "item_lookup = (\n",
    "    items[['No. Article','Division','Catégorie','Groupe de produit','Répliqué-Franchisé']]\n",
    "    .drop_duplicates(subset='No. Article')\n",
    "    .copy()\n",
    ")\n",
    "item_lookup['No. Article'] = item_lookup['No. Article'].astype(str)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Join onto Vente\n",
    "vente[\"No. d'article\"] = vente[\"No. d'article\"].astype(str)\n",
    "vente = vente.merge(\n",
    "    item_lookup,\n",
    "    left_on=\"No. d'article\",\n",
    "    right_on='No. Article',\n",
    "    how='left'\n",
    ").drop(columns='No. Article')\n",
    "\n",
    "join_rate = vente['Catégorie'].notna().sum() / len(vente) * 100\n",
    "print(f'Join rate (Catégorie filled): {join_rate:.1f}%')\n",
    "print(f'Unique Catégories in sales  : {vente[\"Catégorie\"].nunique()}')\n",
    "print(f'Unique Groupes in sales     : {vente[\"Groupe de produit\"].nunique()}')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Save item lookup table for downstream use\n",
    "item_lookup.to_csv(DATA_PROCESSED / 'item_category_map.csv', index=False)\n",
    "print('✅ Saved: item_category_map.csv')"
   ]
  },
